==Battleground==
*2 [[Duche]]s spawn after 1.67 seconds<sup>50f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Chun-Li (Enemy)|Chun-Li]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
**12 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
**5 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use units with above 360 range (e.g. [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]], [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Dragon Cat]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] or [[Ururun Cat]]) with 2-3 meatshields. If you're struggling with the angels, bring [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]]. If you have any units with Immune to Knockback, use them!

